+   * @author Christian (graetz23@gmail.com)
+   * @date 14.03.2015 19:41:16
+   * @param samplingRate
+   *          should be great than 2 and likely to be of 2^p | p E N
+   * @param noOfOscillations
+   *          should be of natural numbers except zero
